   "subject": "Re: [geomorph-r-package] Error when plotting shape at min and maximum size",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;color:#0b5394\">Kata,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;color:#0b5394\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;color:#0b5394\">first off, note that you are using an older version of geomorph. The current version of procD.lm does not provide the pieces you are trying to use to plot the min and max of the allometry line, and that might cause issues in the future. So please make sure to install the most recent version of geomorph from either CRAN (you may want to wait a couple of days as a new minor release is on the way) or from github.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;color:#0b5394\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;color:#0b5394\">At present, what you are trying to do could be done using e.g. the function shape.predictor as such:</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;color:#0b5394\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;color:#0b5394\">allom.shapes &lt;- shape.predictor(coords, log(Csize), Intercept = T, method = &quot;LS&quot;,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;color:#0b5394\">                                                 pred.min = min(log(Csize), pred.max = max(log(Csize))))<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;color:#0b5394\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;color:#0b5394\">Then to plot:</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;color:#0b5394\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;color:#0b5394\">plotRefToTarget(mshape(coords), allom.shapes$pred.min) # with any other desired plotting arguments</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;color:#0b5394\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;color:#0b5394\">Hope this helps</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;color:#0b5394\">Antigoni</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;color:#0b5394\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;color:#0b5394\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;color:#0b5394\"><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Fri, Feb 18, 2022 at 2:45 PM María Constanza Marchesi &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">march...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"m_-3330843468572442796_m_-510491262671135664__GoBack\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><span lang=\"ES\">Hello all!<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">I am trying\r\nto plot shapes at maximum and minimum values obtained by the function procD.lm.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">When I run\r\nthe plotRefToTarget function I get an Error warning me about “incorrect number\r\nof dimensions”.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">What may be\r\ncausing this?<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">I am copying\r\nthe code after running it so you can see the error.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Can anyone\r\nhelp me please?<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">#------------------------------------------------ </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&gt;\r\nDelphinidae_Data &lt;- read.table(&quot;01Th_delphinidae_SoloAd.txt&quot;,\r\nheader=T, dec =&quot;.&quot;)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&gt;\r\nDelphinidae_Clasif &lt;-read.csv(file =\r\n&quot;01Th_IDdelphinidae_SoloAd.csv&quot;, header = T,sep = &quot;;&quot;,dec =\r\n&quot;.&quot;)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&gt;\r\nDelphinidae_Clasif$Sp&lt;-as.factor(Delphinidae_Clasif$Sp)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&gt;\r\nDelphinidae_Clasif$Subfamily&lt;-as.factor(Delphinidae_Clasif$Subfamily)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&gt; Delphinidae_Clasif$Habitat&lt;-as.factor(Delphinidae_Clasif$Habitat)<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&gt;\r\nDelphinidae_3Darray &lt;-\r\narrayspecs(Delphinidae_Data[,2:ncol(Delphinidae_Data)], 35, 3)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&gt; Delphinidae_GPA &lt;- gpagen(Delphinidae_3Darray)<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"> \r\n|=======================================================================================|\r\n100%<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&gt;\r\ngdf_delph&lt;-geomorph.data.frame(Delphinidae_GPA,SP=Delphinidae_Clasif$Sp,Subfamily=Delphinidae_Clasif$Subfamily,Habitat=Delphinidae_Clasif$Habitat)<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&gt; GPref&lt;- gridPar(<a href=\"http://pt.bg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://pt.bg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483934294000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3iLEUxBIwmSli3KryMxqf_\">pt.bg</a> = &quot;grey&quot;, pt.size\r\n=0.8, link.col=&quot;gray&quot;, link.lwd=2, <a href=\"http://tar.pt.bg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://tar.pt.bg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483934294000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Qb4Y6ofBexmWCXhzBaTGb\">tar.pt.bg</a> = &quot;black&quot;,\r\ntar.pt.size = 1, tar.link.col = &quot;black&quot;)<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&gt; <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&gt;\r\n#Wireframe<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&gt; frame\r\n&lt;- matrix(c(1,1,10,10,\r\n2,6,6,3,3,7,7,4,4,8,8,5,5,9,9,2,28,24,24,31,31,27,27,30,30,26,26,29,29,25,25,28,6,21,21,9,21,20,20,22,22,10,10,11,11,12,12,14,14,13,13,16,16,17,17,18,18,19,19,21,14,31,14,28,14,34,34,35,35,15,<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">+                  \r\n15,33,33,32,32,21,6,28,3,25,7,29,4,26,8,30,5,27,9,31,2,24), ncol = 2,\r\nbyrow = TRUE)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&gt;\r\nmeanshape&lt;-mshape(gdf_delph$coords)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&gt;\r\nxflia&lt;-procD.lm(coords~log(Csize), data = gdf_delph,inter=100000,RRPP =\r\nFALSE)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Preliminary\r\nModel Fit...</span> </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Coefficients\r\nestimation: 1000 permutations.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> \r\n|=======================================================================================|\r\n100%<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Sums of\r\nSquares calculations: 1000 permutations.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  |=======================================================================================|\r\n100%<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&gt;\r\nsummary(xflia)</span> </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Analysis of\r\nVariance, using Residual Randomization<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Permutation\r\nprocedure: Randomization of raw values (residuals of mean) <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Number of\r\npermutations: 1000 <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Estimation\r\nmethod: Ordinary Least Squares <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Sums of\r\nSquares and Cross-products: Type I <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Effect\r\nsizes (Z) based on F distributions<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">            Df      SS      \r\nMS     Rsq      F     \r\nZ Pr(&gt;F)   <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">log(Csize)   1 0.05182 0.051824 0.04129 4.6516\r\n3.4824  0.001 **<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Residuals  108 1.20326 0.011141 0.95871                        <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Total      109 1.25508                                         <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">---<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Signif.\r\ncodes:  0 ‘***’ 0.001 ‘**’ 0.01 ‘*’ 0.05\r\n‘.’ 0.1 ‘ ’ 1<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Call:\r\nprocD.lm(f1 = coords ~ log(Csize), RRPP = FALSE, data = gdf_delph,      inter = 1e+05)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&gt;\r\nplotRefToTarget(M1=meanshape, M2=xflia$Ahat.at.min,\r\nmethod=&quot;points&quot;,gridPars = GPref, links=frame)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">Error\r\nin M2[links[i, 1], ] : incorrect number of dimensions<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&gt;\r\nplotRefToTarget(M1=meanshape, M2=xflia$shape.at.max, gridPars= GPref,\r\nmethod=&quot;points&quot;, links=frame )<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">Error\r\nin M2[links[i, 1], ] : incorrect number of dimensions<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\">Thank you in advance</font></span></p><div><br></div><div>Cheers</div><div><br></div><div>Kata</div><div><br></div><div><br></div>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:start;text-indent:0px\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:start;text-indent:0px\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:start;text-indent:0px\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:start;text-indent:0px\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:start;text-indent:0px\"><div><font face=\"garamond, serif\" size=\"4\" style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);letter-spacing:normal;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><i><b>Dra. María Constanza (Kata) Marchesi</b></i></font><div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:normal;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><i style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><font face=\"garamond, serif\" size=\"2\">Becaria Posdoctoral / Postdoctoral fellow</font></i></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:normal;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><i><font face=\"Times\" style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></font></i></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:normal;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing: